{type:PickOne|question:Translate မင်္ဂလာပါ (mìn ga là pà)|options:[Bye][Hello][How are you?]|answer:Hello|id:TiFSdLiUmKxa}
{type:FlashCard|front:မင်္ဂလာပါ
(Mìn ga là pà)|back:Hello
(Lit. Blessings to you)|id:LtzyMRJGmYmh}
{type:PickOne|question:Translate တွေ့ရတာ ဝမ်းသာပါတယ်
(tway ya tà wán thà pà tè)|options:[See you later][Nice to meet you][Hello]|answer:Nice to meet you|id:GuKxbSJj3SAD}
{type:FlashCard|front:တွေ့ရတာ ဝမ်းသာပါတယ်
(tway ya tà wán thà pà tè)|back:Nice to meet you
(Lit. I'm glad to get to meet you)|id:ofLCUqib3ZeE}
{type:PickOne|question:How do you say “ I'm glad ” in Burmese?|options:[ဝမ်းသာပါတယ်][မင်္ဂလာပါ][ဘာလုပ်နေလဲ]|answer:ဝမ်းသာပါတယ်|id:LxyDcr2w1wGx}
{type:PickOne|question:How do you say “ to meet (you) ” in Burmese?|options:[တွေ့ရတာ][ဗိုက်ဆာတယ်][အိပ်ချင်တယ်]|answer:တွေ့ရတာ|id:l2D5XK5ulh7m}
{type:FlashCard|front:‌နေကောင်းလား
(này káun lá)|back:How are you?
